WEBVTT

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:35.820
I am Bara-Suishou.

00:01:36.660 --> 00:01:40.140
The seventh Rozen Maiden doll.

00:01:45.030 --> 00:01:47.920
Enju

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:53.820
Shinku!

00:01:55.790 --> 00:01:56.690
Holie!

00:02:11.610 --> 00:02:13.060
Shinku...

00:02:20.700 --> 00:02:21.820
Shinku...

00:02:27.300 --> 00:02:28.090
Shinku!

00:02:36.670 --> 00:02:37.750
Shinku!

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:41.810
Pitiful.

00:02:43.570 --> 00:02:46.560
You are pitiful.

00:02:47.570 --> 00:02:49.320
You cannot fight, can you?

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.690
How weak and pitiful.

00:02:54.820 --> 00:02:59.150
In that case, I shall break you.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:47.150
Beware of rabbits' nests.

00:03:47.630 --> 00:03:51.400
So you do not lose your fleet footing.

00:03:57.700 --> 00:03:59.610
That hurt, damn it.

00:04:03.430 --> 00:04:05.080
The seventh doll...

00:04:05.600 --> 00:04:07.830
Bara-Suishou...

00:04:10.720 --> 00:04:14.030
There are a total of
seven Rozen Maidens,

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.090
but there was one sister
I had never met.

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:22.570
My other sisters awoke
in the same era I did,

00:04:22.570 --> 00:04:24.590
but she alone was different.

00:04:24.930 --> 00:04:27.130
The seventh doll no one knows.

00:04:27.470 --> 00:04:28.990
The final sister.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:30.820
That is Bara-Suishou.

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:36.280
Our meeting is proof that
we sisters are all awake now.

00:04:36.680 --> 00:04:38.010
A message from Father

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:42.250
to begin theAlice Game
and bring Alice into this world.

00:04:43.060 --> 00:04:44.810
I see...

00:04:46.020 --> 00:04:49.040
But you don't want to fight, right?

00:04:50.680 --> 00:04:51.950
I...

00:04:54.260 --> 00:04:55.540
Yay!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.230
Mr. Elephant Number 1,
taking off!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.160
Paoo!

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:01.430
Mr. Elephant!
Mr. Elephant! Paoo!

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:04.340
Seeing that watering can
pisses me off somehow.

00:05:04.900 --> 00:05:07.080
And from a hundred-yen shop...

00:05:07.420 --> 00:05:09.080
It's a mockery!

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.180
Everyone, time for breakfast!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:15.450
Coming!

00:05:19.100 --> 00:05:20.980
Hina wants jam!

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:22.300
All right.

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:23.590
Morning.

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:25.640
Good morning!

00:05:25.640 --> 00:05:27.830
Oh, you're here again?

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.610
Quiet, you.

00:05:29.610 --> 00:05:32.330
I came through the front door,
so quit complaining.

00:05:33.980 --> 00:05:36.080
Oh? Where's Shinku?

00:05:36.220 --> 00:05:37.990
I called her earlier...

00:05:38.260 --> 00:05:39.720
She's still sleeping.

00:05:40.500 --> 00:05:41.580
That's unusual.

00:05:42.270 --> 00:05:43.580
Was she up late?

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:47.400
Hell if I know.

00:05:48.680 --> 00:05:52.250
Come to think of it, she's recently
been reading late into the night.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.430
Has she?

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:55.990
Jam! Jam!

00:05:57.520 --> 00:05:58.760
Thank you!

00:05:59.350 --> 00:06:01.240
I wonder what she's reading.

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.260
I don't know.

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.000
Well, I'll be going.

00:06:06.270 --> 00:06:08.030
See you later!

00:06:08.030 --> 00:06:10.940
Don't cut corners just
because it's practice!

00:06:11.680 --> 00:06:14.010
Shinku never showed up.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:15.280
Forget her.

00:06:15.280 --> 00:06:19.010
Now Hina's gonna give water
to flowers with Mr. Elephant!

00:06:19.770 --> 00:06:22.230
Mr. Elephant! Mr. Elephant!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:25.070
Wait, this is terrible!

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:30.020
It may be your fault that
Shinku hasn't gotten up!

00:06:30.370 --> 00:06:33.500
Are you sure you didn't anger her?

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:34.390
Hina?

00:06:34.730 --> 00:06:36.130
Right!

00:06:36.130 --> 00:06:38.380
When Shinku's really, truly angry,

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:41.560
she shuts her case and
doesn't talk to anyone.

00:06:41.560 --> 00:06:44.390
And once her anger has built up...

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:46.680
she'll erupt in a huge explosion!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:49.650
Hina-Ichigo!

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.760
Hina never... Hina never...

00:06:53.070 --> 00:06:54.970
So scary!

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:56.410
What'll I do? What'll I do?

00:06:54.970 --> 00:06:56.410
We should check to make sure.

00:07:02.330 --> 00:07:03.650
She's still sleeping.

00:07:04.000 --> 00:07:05.930
Never mind, just go in.

00:07:13.560 --> 00:07:14.800
This is terrible!

00:07:14.800 --> 00:07:15.700
This is bad!

00:07:15.700 --> 00:07:17.260
This is absolutely awful!

00:07:17.260 --> 00:07:19.390
That's Hina and Shinku's shelf!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.200
Take a good look!

00:07:23.980 --> 00:07:26.810
Detective
Kun-kun

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:26.810
That little pouch!

00:07:28.230 --> 00:07:33.040
It's over the line!
This is what Shinku is angry about!

00:07:35.070 --> 00:07:36.150
<i>Listen.</i>

00:07:36.150 --> 00:07:40.550
<i>I'll allow you to borrow part of my space,
but do not cross this line.</i>

00:07:40.550 --> 00:07:41.650
<i>Roger!</i>

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:43.730
<i>That's my shelf.</i>

00:07:45.490 --> 00:07:47.820
This is bad.

00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:49.730
No wonder Shinku's angry.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.340
I wonder.

00:07:51.340 --> 00:07:52.970
Shh, okay?

00:07:57.760 --> 00:07:59.680
What a commotion.

00:07:59.910 --> 00:08:00.970
Hina-Ichigo.

00:08:00.970 --> 00:08:02.180
Y-Yes?

00:08:03.010 --> 00:08:04.600
Please make some tea.

00:08:04.600 --> 00:08:06.150
I'll have it downstairs.

00:08:06.370 --> 00:08:09.380
Y-Yes, ma'am!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:18.410
What?

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:20.900
Shinku, did something happen?

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:23.880
Not especially.

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:28.770
Join me for tea?

00:08:29.490 --> 00:08:30.400
Sure.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:35.050
She's as kooky as ever.

00:08:44.050 --> 00:08:47.620
<i>Jun, I'd like you to keep
today's events to yourself.</i>

00:08:48.070 --> 00:08:48.620
<i>But...</i>

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:51.700
<i>They won't know what to do anymore</i>

00:08:51.700 --> 00:08:55.320
<i>if they hear the
seventh doll has appeared.</i>

00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:14.000
There's no way there's anything
written about the seventh doll.

00:09:14.540 --> 00:09:16.220
And I can't read it...

00:09:16.220 --> 00:09:17.270
What language?

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:18.700
What...

00:09:18.700 --> 00:09:19.820
Morning.

00:09:19.820 --> 00:09:20.750
M-Morning.

00:09:30.690 --> 00:09:32.970
Don't feel shy about staying.

00:09:32.970 --> 00:09:36.100
Oh, no. We promised
to eat at home today.

00:09:36.490 --> 00:09:40.970
Grandma is feeling well today,
so she's cooking for once.

00:09:41.540 --> 00:09:42.640
I see.

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:43.680
I'm glad.

00:09:48.840 --> 00:09:49.810
Shinku-chan...

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:52.470
What's gotten into her?

00:09:52.470 --> 00:09:57.820
Shinku, Suiseiseki and
Souseiseki are leaving!

00:09:59.700 --> 00:10:01.060
I'm back.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:04.460
Jun-kun...

00:10:23.940 --> 00:10:24.920
Hey...

00:10:30.150 --> 00:10:32.490
Hey, aren't you going to sleep?

00:10:34.360 --> 00:10:35.040
Hey.

00:10:35.040 --> 00:10:36.220
Am I disturbing you?

00:10:36.220 --> 00:10:39.480
Not exactly, but...

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:42.770
If I am disturbing you,
I will go downstairs.

00:10:44.880 --> 00:10:47.020
Hey, hold on a second.

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:51.830
Don't you think you should tell them?

00:10:52.230 --> 00:10:53.740
About the seventh doll...

00:10:54.430 --> 00:10:55.850
You're sisters, right?

00:10:56.470 --> 00:10:59.840
If I did, it would only
stir up unneeded unrest.

00:11:00.080 --> 00:11:02.350
Then handle it a little better.

00:11:03.480 --> 00:11:05.330
Everyone's already worried.

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:09.260
Sis, Hina-Ichigo, Suiseiseki,
and Souseiseki.

00:11:11.030 --> 00:11:14.500
Cooped up in the room morning and night,
barely talking...

00:11:15.080 --> 00:11:17.780
Anyone would think that's strange.

00:11:18.140 --> 00:11:21.940
I was asked today if something
happened to you. Everyone's...

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:24.050
Just ignore such things.

00:11:24.210 --> 00:11:26.240
I can't exactly do that.

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:30.520
You may be fine with that,
but consider our feelings...

00:11:30.520 --> 00:11:32.110
I do not want to hear this from you!

00:11:33.760 --> 00:11:36.850
You can forget what you
did and say that to me?

00:11:37.470 --> 00:11:38.890
That's not related to this!

00:11:39.370 --> 00:11:40.890
So you're running away again?

00:11:41.450 --> 00:11:42.850
I'm not running away!

00:11:42.850 --> 00:11:44.130
You are!

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:51.680
What the heck?
I was worried about you.

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:53.120
Do whatever you want.

00:12:27.760 --> 00:12:29.040
Shinku...

00:13:06.350 --> 00:13:08.840
I don't get it...

00:13:12.760 --> 00:13:14.140
Shinku...

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:16.760
Are you still mad?

00:13:17.430 --> 00:13:19.920
Come on, Shinku...

00:13:22.440 --> 00:13:24.100
She still hasn't gotten up?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:25.120
No...

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:28.090
She must be absolutely furious.

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:33.200
But, but Hina fixed it so
it's not crossing the line!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.760
Such optimism.

00:13:34.760 --> 00:13:38.810
There's no way her anger will be mollified
by something like that.

00:13:43.130 --> 00:13:44.660
Souseiseki?

00:13:58.160 --> 00:13:58.820
Shinku.

00:13:59.850 --> 00:14:04.760
Even for a sister, disturbing one's sleep
is unforgivable, Souseiseki.

00:14:05.330 --> 00:14:06.860
You weren't sleeping.

00:14:10.610 --> 00:14:13.600
Shinku, I need to talk to you.

00:14:16.180 --> 00:14:18.070
We got kicked out again.

00:14:18.070 --> 00:14:19.040
Boo.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:23.180
It cannot be helped since
you are a meathead.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:24.920
Is that tasty?

00:14:24.920 --> 00:14:27.100
Not that kind of meat.

00:14:27.100 --> 00:14:31.130
Then you're a meathead too
since you're with Hina!

00:14:31.130 --> 00:14:33.710
Precisely! No!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:34.890
Why would I be a meathead?

00:14:34.890 --> 00:14:36.230
Souseiseki.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.560
What did you wish to discuss?

00:14:39.290 --> 00:14:42.190
I was thinking you weren't
like yourself at all.

00:14:42.400 --> 00:14:43.210
Me?

00:14:43.210 --> 00:14:45.300
You're troubling Jun-kun.

00:14:45.650 --> 00:14:48.420
He's working frantically to catch up now

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:50.540
so he can return to school
in the second term.

00:14:51.360 --> 00:14:54.560
It's not like you to cause
him worry, given that.

00:14:55.090 --> 00:14:56.400
Did something happen?

00:14:56.830 --> 00:14:57.780
Nothing.

00:14:58.540 --> 00:15:02.570
Like your current master, even with major
worries,

00:15:02.570 --> 00:15:04.380
you won't talk about it.

00:15:04.980 --> 00:15:06.120
What a troublesome little sister.

00:15:08.590 --> 00:15:12.180
I'll be lax, and if it's a
problem between you two...

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:14.130
I'll leave it at this.

00:15:14.760 --> 00:15:18.800
But it's a different story
if it concerns the Alice Game.

00:15:21.020 --> 00:15:24.200
The Alice Game concerns us all.

00:15:25.920 --> 00:15:28.880
It's something that troubles
all the Rozen Maidens.

00:15:45.590 --> 00:15:46.720
Hello.

00:15:46.920 --> 00:15:48.020
H-Hey.

00:15:57.990 --> 00:15:58.980
Say.

00:16:00.380 --> 00:16:02.670
There's somewhere I want to drop by.

00:16:04.220 --> 00:16:05.680
Would you join me?

00:16:05.680 --> 00:16:06.860
S-Sure.

00:16:21.920 --> 00:16:22.830
This is the place.

00:16:33.840 --> 00:16:34.860
Dolls?

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:39.230
Yes, I only learned of this
place recently myself.

00:16:39.880 --> 00:16:41.880
Doll Maker
Enju

00:16:40.360 --> 00:16:41.880
Enju-sensei...

00:16:46.400 --> 00:16:47.880
Pardon me.

00:16:48.250 --> 00:16:49.490
Yes!

00:16:50.860 --> 00:16:52.190
Welcome!

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:55.410
Oh, it's you,
Kashiwaba-san.

00:16:55.410 --> 00:16:56.930
May we look around?

00:16:57.720 --> 00:17:00.760
We close at five,
but if that's enough time...

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.000
Okay.

00:17:02.000 --> 00:17:04.120
Oh? And who's this?

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:05.440
A classmate.

00:17:06.130 --> 00:17:08.940
Could he be...
your boyfriend?

00:17:09.300 --> 00:17:10.740
He's a friend.

00:17:15.670 --> 00:17:17.150
They're all handmade.

00:17:18.100 --> 00:17:21.060
There's a craftsman in
the back making them.

00:17:21.060 --> 00:17:22.510
I see.

00:17:23.610 --> 00:17:25.520
You have an interest in dolls?

00:17:26.850 --> 00:17:28.760
Uh, well...

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:32.070
You needn't be shy because you're a boy.

00:17:32.070 --> 00:17:33.860
In fact, it makes me really happy.

00:17:36.240 --> 00:17:38.020
They're well made, aren't they?

00:17:38.200 --> 00:17:41.120
At times, they almost
seem like they're alive.

00:17:41.720 --> 00:17:43.610
Like they might have minds of their own.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.740
Long ago, there was someone
who came in to sell some dolls.

00:17:49.720 --> 00:17:53.970
This person cherished dolls very much
and gave them much love.

00:17:54.380 --> 00:17:55.900
Truly loved them...

00:17:56.260 --> 00:17:58.990
but the dolls never gave back anything.

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.800
They would only sit there silently.

00:18:03.400 --> 00:18:05.550
Nothing could be more futile.

00:18:05.860 --> 00:18:07.710
That's what this person said.

00:18:08.860 --> 00:18:11.400
But this is what I think...

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.140
It's not that dolls don't
give back anything.

00:18:14.770 --> 00:18:16.500
It's that they can't.

00:18:16.910 --> 00:18:22.140
Their feelings just don't reach us,
no matter how they try.

00:18:23.420 --> 00:18:28.510
So I hope you don't come to hate dolls
and will always love them.

00:18:29.180 --> 00:18:31.360
Was I trying too hard
to make an impression?

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:36.900
You two are a cold crowd...

00:18:37.930 --> 00:18:39.200
Oh well.

00:18:39.200 --> 00:18:41.090
Come and visit anytime.

00:18:41.090 --> 00:18:42.600
Oh, we'll have a new one soon.

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:45.190
It'll be a real masterpiece.

00:18:45.190 --> 00:18:45.970
Um...

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:08.150
How is it going?

00:19:13.120 --> 00:19:14.430
Not bad.

00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:19.500
I'm back.

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:21.570
You were out late.

00:19:21.800 --> 00:19:23.140
Yeah.

00:19:24.630 --> 00:19:26.170
Jun's bag is big!

00:19:27.440 --> 00:19:29.140
Could it be unyuu?

00:19:29.580 --> 00:19:31.490
Uh, no, it's not.

00:19:31.490 --> 00:19:32.990
It's okay, Jun-kun.

00:19:32.990 --> 00:19:37.150
It's natural for adolescent boys
to be interested in magazines like that.

00:19:37.150 --> 00:19:38.180
That's not it!

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:39.820
Then what is it?

00:19:40.340 --> 00:19:43.270
Well, um, this is...

00:19:43.270 --> 00:19:45.040
You don't have to say.

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:45.920
Like I said...

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:50.270
Welcome home.

00:19:50.560 --> 00:19:51.560
I'm back.

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.420
You were out late.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:19:56.000
Yeah...

00:20:09.410 --> 00:20:10.280
Jun.

00:20:10.880 --> 00:20:12.860
W-What?

00:20:15.650 --> 00:20:18.760
I told everyone about Bara-Suishou.

00:20:20.040 --> 00:20:20.760
Really.

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:25.990
They all told me that
everything would be fine.

00:20:26.250 --> 00:20:28.960
That if we all stay together, surely...

00:20:29.720 --> 00:20:30.890
I see.

00:20:31.410 --> 00:20:32.370
That's great.

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:33.640
Yes.

00:20:42.450 --> 00:20:43.290
Here.

00:20:43.690 --> 00:20:44.380
What is it?

00:20:57.420 --> 00:20:59.110
Say, Jun...

00:21:00.300 --> 00:21:02.480
It seems I worried you.

00:21:02.480 --> 00:21:04.480
Nah, I was also...

00:21:04.870 --> 00:21:07.360
Well, I'll forgive you this time.

00:21:07.360 --> 00:21:08.380
What?

00:21:08.570 --> 00:21:10.470
Study diligently.

00:21:10.470 --> 00:21:11.470
Hold on!

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.020
You're the one who started...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:16.360
Do not touch me so familiarly.

00:21:16.360 --> 00:21:18.560
You are my servant.

00:21:19.100 --> 00:21:20.670
Damn it...

00:21:20.670 --> 00:21:22.330
"Pick me up." "Don't touch me."

00:21:22.330 --> 00:21:24.170
You say whatever suits you!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.280
Hey, Nori,

00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:26.470
I don't recall becoming your servant!

00:21:24.280 --> 00:21:25.940
why does it make sounds?

00:21:26.470 --> 00:21:28.760
That's because inside,
there are little...

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:31.370
Will it really be all right?

00:21:31.580 --> 00:21:33.290
To think the seventh
doll has appeared...

00:21:35.400 --> 00:21:38.300
We'll have to start by
meeting this little sister.

00:21:38.980 --> 00:21:40.560
That's true, but...

00:21:40.840 --> 00:21:45.540
But we've got someone
who'll always watch over us.

00:21:52.180 --> 00:21:54.980
This is what you do every single time!

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:55.820
Are you listening?

00:21:56.460 --> 00:21:58.820
Honestly, what a noisy servant.

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:01.110
Jun, go make me some tea.

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:03.410
Why do I have to?

00:22:03.410 --> 00:22:04.730
I'm not drinking any!

00:22:04.730 --> 00:22:07.330
If you want tea,
go make it yourself...

00:22:07.760 --> 00:22:08.910
Quickly.

00:22:08.910 --> 00:22:10.240
What?

00:23:42.740 --> 00:23:44.960
The yard's noisy lately.

00:23:44.960 --> 00:23:46.890
I do sense someone watching.

00:23:47.170 --> 00:23:49.550
Could it be a burglar?

00:23:49.550 --> 00:23:50.890
Hina-Ichigo, go look.

00:23:51.600 --> 00:23:53.110
Alone? I'm scared!

00:23:53.110 --> 00:23:54.210
Don't worry.

00:23:54.210 --> 00:23:57.220
The one making
the noise is probably her.

00:23:57.220 --> 00:23:59.700
Oh, I can see an umbrella over there!

00:24:00.380 --> 00:24:03.370
Next time on Rozen Maiden Träumend.

00:24:03.120 --> 00:24:10.880
Chapter 3
Kanaria

00:24:03.370 --> 00:24:06.080
Its melody is like a dream.
